      },
      {
        "text": "Media coverage disproportionately favors dramatic events over substantive policy matters.",
        "confidence": 0.92
      },
      {
        "text": "Public interest tends to gravitate toward extreme or sensationalized stories.",
        "confidence": 0.91
      },
      {
        "text": "A colleague was stripped of committees and held a press conference.",
